  Unconditional All-Prefix Loop Theorem, and Matched-Scope Charon ULLBC/LLBC Comparison

  Key C2 & C3 properties:
  1. Executes the decoded `WirePackage` (`WireBody`, `WireBlock`, `WireStmt`, `WireTerm`)
